SUMMARY:P.J. Whelihans: Eat for Good for Lancaster Education Foundation
DESCRIPTION:Good food can make a difference. Join us on Thursday\, Aug. 20\, from 4-10 p.m. at P.J. Whelihan’s for the Lancaster Education Foundation’s Eat for Good fundraiser. \nWhether you dine in or take your meal to go\, 15% of your purchase will support the Lancaster Education Foundation and its work to create meaningful opportunities for School District of Lancaster students. \nOver the years\, LEF has helped adopt 195 classrooms\, supported more than 10\,400 students\, and distributed 12\,000+ books to second graders. Every meal helps continue that impact. \nIf you’re dining in\, be sure to bring the flyer. If you’re ordering takeout\, simply mention the Lancaster Education Foundation when you place your order. \n\nLocated in: The Shoppes at Belmont\nAddress: 1569 Fruitville Pike\, Lancaster\, PA 17601\n\nClick here to download PDF 
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/p-j-whelihans-eat-for-good-for-lancaster-education-foundation/
LOCATION:PA
CATEGORIES:Community
END:VEVENT
